  "final_text": "New chat\nImages\nPlugins\nDeep research\nSee plans and pricing\nHelp\nSettings\nGet responses tailored to you\n\nLog in to get answers based on saved chats, plus create images and upload files.\n\nLog in\nChatGPT\nLog in\nSign up for free\nYou said:\n\nhii\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHii! \ud83d\udc4b\ud83d\ude0a How are you doing? What can I help you with today?\n\nYou said:\n\nhwllo my name is reo\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHello, Reo! \ud83d\udc4b\ud83d\ude0a Nice to meet you! What would you like to do today?\n\nYou said:\n\nwhats your name\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nI'm ChatGPT! \ud83d\ude04 You can call me ChatGPT, or give me a nickname if you'd like, Reo. \u2728\n\nYou said:\n\nsuper tell mee the 20 best tamil movies\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nAbsolutely, Reo! \ud83d\ude0e\ud83c\udfac If you mean 20 of the best Tamil movies ever, here's a mix of classics, modern masterpieces, action, comedy, romance, and thrillers:\n\n\ud83c\udfad Nayakan (1987) \u2014 Kamal Haasan\n\n\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Anbe Sivam (2003) \u2014 Kamal Haasan, Madhavan\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Pariyerum Perumal (2018) \u2014 Kathir, Anandhi\n\n\u2764\ufe0f 96 (2018) \u2014 Vijay Sethupathi, Trisha\n\n\ud83e\udde0 Vikram Vedha (2017) \u2014 Madhavan, Vijay Sethupathi\n\n\ud83c\udfc3 Ratsasan (2018) \u2014 Vishnu Vishal, Amala Paul\n\n\ud83d\udc51 Thevar Magan (1992) \u2014 Kamal Haasan, Sivaji Ganesan\n\nChatGPT is AI and can make mistakes.\n\nChat with ChatGPT",
